{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body>\n    <p>厭倦了一成不變的數位時鐘嗎？現在有一個絕佳機會，讓你的 iPhone 或 iPad 變身成為充滿懷舊魅力的經典翻頁式時刻表，這款《AeroFlap》應用程式今天限時免費中。它不僅能解決你對復古科技的渴望，更為你的桌面或床頭櫃增添獨特的藝術氛圍，非常適合追求生活品味與設計感的科技愛好者，現在就立即下載，感受時光流轉的優雅韻味。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/460x460bb-75-34.webp\" alt=\"限時免費\">\n    <h2>復古美學與智能科技完美融合</h2>\n    <p>《AeroFlap》以其極度逼真的 3D 翻頁動畫與經典機械音效，將裝置化為懷舊時刻表，完美展現獨特美學。它不僅能提供精確的實時時間與即時天氣資訊，更融入了 AI 訊息生成功能，可帶來個性化問候或勵志名言。用戶還能自由設定顯示內容與板面主題顏色，創造專屬風格。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-2-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-3-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-4-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2796x1290bb-5-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"App Screenshot\">\n    <ul>\n      <li>應用名稱：AeroFlap Split-Flap Clock AI+</li>\n      <li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n      <li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T12:02:17.719207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}